{
  "name": "Facebook Lead Ads to HubSpot with welcome SMS",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Facebook Lead Ads to HubSpot with welcome SMS\n\n**What it does**\nEvery new lead from your Facebook or Instagram lead form is created (or updated) as a HubSpot contact, gets a deal in your pipeline, and receives a short welcome text within seconds.\n\n**You need**\nA Facebook Lead Ads credential (OAuth, needs a Meta app), a HubSpot private app token with contacts and deals scopes, and a Twilio account.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Connect the three credentials.\n2. In **New Facebook lead**, pick your Page and lead form.\n3. In **Create deal**, pick your pipeline stage. Fill in the yellow notes.\n4. Activate. Use Meta's Lead Ads Testing Tool to send a test lead.\n\nBuilt by AI Strike Force, aistrikeforce.com",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 580
      },
      "id": "e350ae1e-dc22-5e44-ba66-a56013ee0465",
      "name": "Facebook Lead Ads to HubSpot with welcome SMS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Edit me\nSelect your Facebook Page and the lead form to watch. Lead forms should ask for full name, email and phone number.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 260,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "ebe5213d-75a0-52d3-9d44-8ac4e8e65f11",
      "name": "Edit me: page and form",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Edit me\n**Create deal**: choose the stage (the default pipeline's first stage is `appointmentscheduled`) and an amount if you have a typical deal size.\n**Send welcome SMS**: set *From* to your Twilio number and rewrite the text.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "b09dc531-eb63-5409-8c57-d0ee1cd40ba1",
      "name": "Edit me: deal and SMS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        600,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "event": "newLead",
        "page": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_PAGE_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "form": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_FORM_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "46536bcf-9ba1-528f-bf62-1417eb3d8195",
      "name": "New Facebook lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.facebookLeadAdsTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "facebookLeadAdsOAuth2Api": {
          "name": "Facebook Lead Ads account"
        }
      },
      "webhookId": "8e41ae73-3f87-5256-ae1e-6ae17e41d306"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "6a907396-934c-573c-a313-9b27835b647f",
              "name": "full_name",
              "value": "={{ ($json.data.full_name || [$json.data.first_name, $json.data.last_name].filter(Boolean).join(' ')).trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "4f4707df-4945-5bbb-89e5-5c8171b272c5",
              "name": "first_name",
              "value": "={{ ($json.data.first_name || ($json.data.full_name || '').trim().split(' ')[0] || '').trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "2f24daef-6ecc-5030-bb94-a99db22bbfc4",
              "name": "last_name",
              "value": "={{ ($json.data.last_name || ($json.data.full_name || '').trim().split(' ').slice(1).join(' ') || '').trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "2795ee3a-c40d-576e-8b16-866ee8d4c012",
              "name": "email",
              "value": "={{ ($json.data.email || '').trim().toLowerCase() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "34cf09b7-c81e-5c04-aa9d-fdf40dbaf3cf",
              "name": "phone",
              "value": "={{ ($json.data.phone_number || '').replace(/[^0-9+]/g, '') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "12bd6151-e54e-5bd8-853a-eef783db32e5",
              "name": "form_name",
              "value": "={{ $json.form?.name || 'Facebook lead form' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cdd20d35-25a6-567a-8ae1-0a549a2d9ead",
              "name": "campaign",
              "value": "={{ $json.campaign?.name || $json.adset?.name || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "170c38ed-1004-5c9b-a99c-aeed105bad0f",
      "name": "Map lead fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "appToken",
        "resource": "contact",
        "operation": "upsert",
        "email": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "firstName": "={{ $json.first_name }}",
          "lastName": "={{ $json.last_name }}",
          "phoneNumber": "={{ $json.phone }}",
          "lifeCycleStage": "lead"
        }
      },
      "id": "b9ae6600-53e7-5817-a18d-ee52f7d77d3c",
      "name": "Create or update HubSpot contact",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.hubspot",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "hubspotAppToken": {
          "name": "HubSpot account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "appToken",
        "resource": "deal",
        "operation": "create",
        "stage": "appointmentscheduled",
        "additionalFields": {
          "dealName": "={{ $('Map lead fields').item.json.full_name || $('Map lead fields').item.json.email }} ({{ $('Map lead fields').item.json.form_name }})",
          "associatedVids": "={{ $json.vid }}",
          "pipeline": "default",
          "description": "=Facebook lead form: {{ $('Map lead fields').item.json.form_name }}\nCampaign: {{ $('Map lead fields').item.json.campaign || 'unknown' }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "6153ebe2-d3a0-5177-88eb-08cf7f8e8ec4",
      "name": "Create deal",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.hubspot",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "hubspotAppToken": {
          "name": "HubSpot account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 3
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "8413545b-4c7a-5c79-bb42-cea8899a155f",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Map lead fields').item.json.phone }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3d05e9e1-bfec-53b1-9c19-e3dc71f4a172",
      "name": "Has a phone number?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        880,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "from": "+15555550123",
        "to": "={{ $('Map lead fields').item.json.phone }}",
        "message": "=Hi {{ $('Map lead fields').item.json.first_name || 'there' }}, thanks for your interest! This is Your Company. We got your details and will call you shortly. Reply STOP to opt out.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "423500b7-d036-5f1f-bcec-56a349850c3d",
      "name": "Send welcome SMS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.twilio",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1100,
        200
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "twilioApi": {
          "name": "Twilio account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
